  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Mawingu Networks Expansion, through Dalberg Global Development Advisors</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant partially funds a feasibility study for Mawingu Networks Limited to support expansion of its network throughout rural and underserved areas in Kenya and into Uganda and Rwanda to increase internet access and rural connectivity throughout East Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
